notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺词(二首) 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"芳菲春色满楼台，人在天涯去不回。\n自倚雕阑看蛱蝶，微风吹送落花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺词(二首) 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"秋到空阶一叶飞，边庭何处雁来稀。\n香闺日日愁无赖，月下寒砧又捣衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读王元美弇州集","author":"佘翔","text":"游生落魄气偏粗，散发扁舟下五湖。\n一自文题元晏后，太冲名已重三都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮偶成","author":"佘翔","text":"溪上柴门昼不开，问奇谁为岁寒来。\n黄昏独坐蒲团静，隔院微风送落梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊严滩","author":"佘翔","text":"落落江湖老鹖冠，扁舟秋水正漫漫。\n吾生可是羊裘客，垂钓还来七里滩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝云墓","author":"佘翔","text":"为雨阳台去不还，孤坟寂寞委空山。\n禅林舞袖当年事，啼鸟春风一梦间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00