e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和郑给舍七夕对雨 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"年年玉渚驾晴虹，今夜双星黯淡中。\n泪洒霓裳收不尽，随风轻著蓼花红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园即事 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"蛱蝶随风过短墙，邻家春满百花香。\n南窗拓得黄庭罢，笑倚阑干看海棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园即事 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"睡起西窗日欲斜，溪边汲水自烹茶。\n捲帘坐看双飞燕，冲落樱桃几片花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园即事 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"春云不雨昼偏寒，翠竹临轩长数竿。\n读罢离骚无别事，自锄芳径艺幽兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园即事 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"东风吹雨到江村，落尽梨花昼掩门。\n柳外莺声春自啭，一庭芳草暗销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪鲁狂 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"桃花潭上旧汪伦，汴上相看冬复春。\n赠我琅玕长七尺，持归东海一垂纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪鲁狂 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"遨游南北访仙踪，老去还乘白岳龙。\n莫讶荷衣香不散，三姑亲赠玉芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪鲁狂 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"与君分手秣陵城，杯酒梁园感慨生。\n家住夷门人自老，有谁虚左过侯嬴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谭仲儆 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"仙凫曾向七闽分，愁满衡阳卧白云。\n今日夷门称吏隐，不知谁是信陵君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谭仲儆 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"衡山历历秀芙蓉，紫盖云中未可从。\n见说藏书千古在，因君直欲跨飞龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谭仲儆 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"风流傲吏有仙才，七泽惟看水一杯。\n迁谪无劳悲偃蹇，游梁且上孝王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谭仲儆 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"邂逅同歌行路难，一尊湖海罄交欢。\n劝君莫拟三闾赋，今日无人似子兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠胡安成","author":"佘翔","text":"金薤纵横见国工，谁云篆刻总雕虫。\n但看一片昆吾铁